as a lot of content you can try out (A small portion of what will be included in the full game of course). I have seen multiple people put over 20 hours into the demo already! 😱 Thank you so much, btw! If you do end up playing, I'd really ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T20:08:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692568","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2677980-1846651706691740","game_id":"steam-2677980","kind":"announcement","title":"Choppy Waters Next Fest Gameplay Stream","summary":"Steam Next Fest is here, and the Choppy Waters demo is free to play! Watch me play the demo during the festival, and if it looks interesting, try it yourself :) I'm a solo dev, and I'm very happy with the current state of the demo. If you agree, please consider wishlisting, it helps me out a ton!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:21:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691740","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2677980-1846018067927691","game_id":"steam-2677980","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - Controller Support","summary":"Controller SupportFull controller support for all major controllers: Xbox, PlayStation, Nintendo Switch Pro and Steam Deck.Button prompts match the controller you're using, even when playing through Steam Input.Switch between mouse and controller at any time.Added controller rumble. You can turn it off under Gameplay Options in Settings.New Ingredient: CucumberCucumber is a new ingredient that gives a sushi +1 AP and +1 HP.It counts as both an AP ingredient and an HP ingredient.It's unlocked fro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T22:26:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927691","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2677980-1834602721191446","game_id":"steam-2677980","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - The Difficulty Patch","summary":"This update focuses mainly on balance, encounter difficulty, and making the demo a bit more challenging overall.Several encounters have been adjusted to show up at better points in the run, many pirates and captains have received stat changes, and a few items, bobbles, and starter deck options have been rebalanced. There are also a handful of bug fixes, clarity improvements, visual updates, and small quality-of-life changes.Major ChangesBomb ReworkBombs have been reworked to behave more like a d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-05T16:53:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721191446","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2677980-1833334318572283","game_id":"steam-2677980","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - The Ludo Narrative Dissonance Update","summary":"Big thank you to everyone who has played the Choppy Waters Demo and shared feedback so far! Some of you mentioned wanting the combat to feel more like pirates eating sushi rather than sushi fighting back, so this update focuses heavily on improving the game’s \"combat\" readability, visual clarity, and overall onboarding experience.Gameplay & Visual ChangesReworked combat visuals to better emphasize pirates eating sushi.Sushi now visibly get more eaten as they lose HP.Added new in-game guides to h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-22T16:31:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318572283","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2677980-1831432155577297","game_id":"steam-2677980","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo is Here!","summary":"The Choppy Waters Demo is officially live on Steam! You can jump in right now and start building your own bizarre, powerful, and occasionally questionable sushi deck!What’s in the Demo?Play through the game’s first region, complete with branching paths and encountersFace off against two possible zone bossesChoose from multiple starter decks, with additional options unlockable through playCraft your own sushi cards using a variety of ingredientsDiscover a selection of items, bobbles, and events t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T12:46:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155577297","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2677980-1831432155572929","game_id":"steam-2677980","kind":"announcement","title":"Very Soon...","summary":"It's finally time! I hope you have all your ducks in a row. I hope you have all your affairs in order. Because the Choppy Waters Demo is just around the corner!The demo will be available to play starting May 4, 2026!What can you expect?In the demo, you’ll get your first taste of Choppy Waters:Play through the game’s first regionCraft your own sushi cards using collected ingredientsExperiment with different builds and strategiesTake on a variety of enemies and encountersFace off against two possi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-02T02:14:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155572929","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2677980-1826362059931500","game_id":"steam-2677980","kind":"announcement","title":"Money","summary":"Money... What is Money?... Money is Coins... Money is Life... Money is Love In Choppy Water Money is your life! If you run out of Coins, that's it baby, you dead!There are several ways to earn coins in Choppy Waters Such as:Slaying your enemies!Opening treasure chests!Committing Fraud! (For legal reasons, this one is a joke. Unfortunately, there are currently no fraud committing mechanics planned for Choppy Waters... but who knows... if the public outcry is great enough...)Earning money is one t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-09T21:13:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059931500","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2677980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:12Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:12Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2677980":"2026-10-26T09:55:12Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2677980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:12Z"},"4516090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:12Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2677980","app_id":2677980,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:09Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"c073a5e5a1d4487d1515874d179f834cd8d349ea161ed